## Fix 7 — external updates during composition

**Symptom:** a value pushed from outside — a "reset" button, a live feed, a
parent re-render — corrupts the field or kills the IME while the user is typing.

**Cause:** React rewrites the runs, destroying the composition node underneath
the input method.

**Fix:** park incoming external values while composing and drain them when the
composition commits.

```js
useEffect(() => {
  if (isComposing.current) { pendingExternal.current = valueProp; return; }
  // apply normally
}, [valueProp]);
```

Drain `pendingExternal` at the end of the same `requestAnimationFrame` callback
that handles the commit.

